# EXPLODE — the bang.
#
# The blast is built by the tool from SIZE and BREAKS_BLOCKS, and the two are genuinely different
# programs rather than one with a flag: breaking uses real primed TNT, while not-breaking is a
# particle, a sound and explosion damage in a radius. Faking the harmless one is the point — a
# seven-year-old throwing bombs around his own base wants the BOOM, not the crater, and finding out
# which he meant afterwards costs him the base.
function effect()
${BLAST}
end
